        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>说明利弊类</title>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Times New Roman\", SimSun, serif;\n    background-color: #e0e0e0;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 20px;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .page-container {\n    background-color: #ffffff;\n    border: 12px solid #1b8b80;\n    padding: 40px 50px;\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 750px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .header-note {\n    text-align: right;\n    color: #1b8b80;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-bottom: 40px;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    color: #1a2bcf;\n    font-size: 24px;\n    margin-top: 0;\n    margin-bottom: 30px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  h2 {\n    color: #d92b2b;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    margin-top: 25px;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .text-block {\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n  .en-text {\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .zh-text {\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"page-container\">\n  <div class=\"header-note\">此份笔记共<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">8页</span>!</div>\n\n  <h1>说明利弊类</h1>\n\n  <h2>第一段：说明现状</h2>\n  <div class=\"text-block\">\n    <p class=\"en-text\">1. Nowadays many people prefer XXX because it has a significant role in our daily life.</p>\n    <p class=\"zh-text\">现在许多人更喜欢 XXX，因为它在我们的日常生活中扮演着重要的角色。</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"text-block\">\n    <p class=\"en-text\">2. Generally, its advantages and disadvantages can be seen as follows.</p>\n    <p class=\"zh-text\">总的来说，它的优缺点如下。</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <h2>第二段：详细说明利弊</h2>\n  <div class=\"text-block\">\n    <p class=\"en-text\">3. First ______ (XXX 的优点之一). Besides ______ (XXX 的优点之二).</p>\n    <p class=\"zh-text\">第一，……。第二，……。</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"text-block\">\n    <p class=\"en-text\">4. But every coin has two sides. The negative aspects are also apparent.</p>\n    <p class=\"zh-text\">但是每件事都有两面性，它的缺点也很明显。</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"text-block\">\n    <p class=\"en-text\">5. One of the obvious disadvantages is that ______ (XXX 的第一个缺点). To make matters worse, ______ (XXX 的第二个缺点).</p>\n    <p class=\"zh-text\">其中一个重要的缺点是，……。更糟糕的是，……。</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <h2>第三段：你对现状（或前景）的看法</h2>\n  <div class=\"text-block\">\n    <p class=\"en-text\">6. Through the above analysis, I believe that the positive aspects overweigh the negative ones. Therefore, I would like to ______ (我的选择).</p>\n    <p class=\"zh-text\">通过以上分析，我认为它的利大于弊。因此，我将会……。</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"text-block\">\n    <p class=\"en-text\">7. From the comparison between these positive and negative effects of XXX, we should deal with it according to the circumstances we are in. Only by this way, ______ (对前景的预测).</p>\n    <p class=\"zh-text\">通过比较 XXX 的利弊，我们应该根据我们所处的情况处理此问题。只有通过这种方式……。</p>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
